{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_haini_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_haini_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"懷有希望之人","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_haini_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"44eb1ed12e5858a238fce0289e6be7e9676a18de2943a281dfd8e61eb587d231","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"盧契拉與深海教徒的聯繫使她成為海巡隊的嚴密監視對象，但她後續的行動出乎所有人的意料。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各組注意，盧契拉正在協助深海教徒逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盧契拉需要被當作新的嫌疑人進行追蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她的舉動足以證明——她有背叛阿戈爾的意圖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"十二小時前，海巡隊辦公室"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說安妮婭“企圖”把佔領了火山能源站的海嗣引到城市來？噗，什麼惡劣的玩笑，還叫她深海教徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不是開玩笑的地方。失竊的海嗣誘導費洛蒙，出海時間，一切線索都指向安妮婭和她的導師。希望你配合我們的調查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們的城市是為了躲避海嗣才開始移動的不是嗎？安妮婭居然會把沒追上我們的海嗣再引過來？呵，她為什麼要這樣做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安妮婭現在怎麼樣了？她在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她的生命徵象已於事發時消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安妮婭她……死了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"narration","text":"坐在透明的穹頂夾層裡，靜靜欣賞穹頂外的景色時，會讓人產生錯覺，彷彿自己正漂浮在海洋中央，被澄澈的海水包圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——頭有點暈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來一點神經穩定劑？對懼高引起的暈眩感有抑制作用——特地為你準備的。怕苦的話還有這個——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧契拉從口袋裡華麗地“變”出了一支甜味劑，安妮婭笑了笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天早上聽說，你的生物探測裝置又被海嗣破壞了，就猜到你結束了之後會過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。去重裝的時候遇到海嗣了，零星幾隻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又……這次有多近？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這半年來，是不是越來越頻繁了？我感覺你每次來的時候，總是很疲憊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡著了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧契拉側過頭看了看。安妮婭把頭靠在她的肩上，正靜靜地欣賞著穹頂外澄澈的海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安妮婭……和我說說，外海真的那麼恐怖嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我每天在最貼近海洋的地方工作，卻從未看見過它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能看見的，只有不斷出海的軍隊，還有你和你的導師，每天為了恢復大洋生態而努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有時候會想……一線的戰場究竟是什麼樣的？我從穹頂看到的安寧，究竟是你們用什麼換來的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"安妮婭低聲說著什麼，盧契拉忍不住側過頭看著她的眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g5_aegirstreet_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧契拉走出海巡隊辦公室時，仍然沒有回過神。她無助地一遍遍聯絡安妮婭，卻始終沒有回應。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧契拉，\n想必你也受到了海巡隊的調查，他們會告訴你，安妮婭試圖引導能源站的海嗣來追擊我們撤退中的城市。\n關於安妮婭的真實死因，我有重要的事實相告。\n看在她的份上，收到訊息後請馬上與我見一面。\n作為她的友人，你不會置之不理，對嗎？\n帕波斯"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（安妮婭的導師……事發那天和她在一起的人！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g1_beaconsquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甩掉了嗎，那些海巡隊的傢伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳……已經看不見他們的制服了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可真是……我只是說他們在跟蹤我，你怎麼就跑起來了……你就不怕海巡隊把你當成我的共犯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要知道真相，在那之前誰也別想抓走您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，安妮婭她真的已經……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"犧牲了，是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們約好一起去看展，她突然爽約，就是為了跟您出海。到底發生了什麼？您被海巡隊跟蹤的事和她有關嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們懷疑我是深海教徒，但是無法證明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜歡這個稱呼。我不信仰任何教義，我只堅信我堅信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以，“是”。安妮婭……呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安妮婭——是我最好的學生，無論是在學術方面，還是在對海嗣的態度上。她什麼都沒和你提過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們不跑了。保持距離，讓他們以為擺脫了跟蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帕波斯接觸的這名女性的身分查到了——技術院設施管理所的穹頂維護員盧契拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道她。不久前我們對她進行了調查，她說就算自己墮落了，安妮婭都不會墮落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"調取距離最近的攝影機，聽聽他們在說什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在說謊。您說您要告訴我真相，但您和海巡隊說得一樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“她是深海教徒，她引導海嗣追擊城市。”好像她的死亡毫不意外，罪有應得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這有什麼不一樣？這算什麼真相？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧契拉，你需要冷靜下來，別這麼大聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很冷靜。在這件荒謬的事裡我是最冷靜的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來找你，是需要你完成她真正的願望。只有你可以做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要你把我藏在礁石裡的安妮婭的遺體運回城市裡。看到她的遺體，你將明白一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的……遺體？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g11_aegirroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，在這裡談話更安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道摯友突然被稱呼為“遺體”，對你來說衝擊很大。但你必須了解她生前為了實現願望作出了何等壯烈的犧牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說這一切是她自己的選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和安妮婭得出的結論是經過了無數次的辯駁和論證的。人類本來就是食物鏈的一環，不想淪為海洋生態圈的底端，只有進化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而進化的頂點——海嗣，向我們敞開大門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了所謂的人類尊嚴而拒絕加入進化的行列，難道不是一種傲慢，不是對人類種群的不負責任嗎？難道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停。什麼進化，什麼傲慢，我聽不懂你在說什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……我理解你的懷疑。的確，安妮婭一開始也像你一樣反感我的提議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你已經知道事實了，她最後甚至奪過我手中的費洛蒙，親手引導海嗣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果承擔的是整個人類的命運，就需要有相應的認知——對即將承受的痛苦、道德的譴責。你認識的安妮婭不是這樣的人嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧契拉瞪著眼前的老者。她想否認她所聽到的，而所有的事實又在拉扯她的內心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您還是沒有說，遺體是怎麼回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在她離開前，她承諾就算計劃沒有成功，也會帶回海嗣的活體細胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最後拚盡全力，回收了她殘留的一隻手。那隻手還緊緊握著她承諾過的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒辦法從正常管道把它帶進來，你知道的。穹頂上有清潔機器人的出入口，那個大小正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要作為穹頂維護員的你施展一些小手段，騙過他們的監管……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安妮婭的願望……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果，這真的是她的願望……只要把她帶回家，就好了，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，藏著她的……遺體的礁石在哪裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g10_shipinterior"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（能源站附近的礁石群裡，藏著安妮婭和她的願望……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要做好心理準備，盧契拉。距離事發已經過去二十四小時，你朋友的遺體將面目全非。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我只是想親眼見證——她最後的願望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在接受調查的過程中提到過，自己也曾有過墮落的想法。但你決定向我們檢舉帕波斯，你做出了正確的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是覺得，讓海嗣來追擊城市這種事，不像是她的願望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管你這麼說，我還是希望你再考慮一下我們的提議。帕波斯現在已經躲藏起來了，由你把他約出來，能夠提高我們的效率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1391_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在標記範圍內找到了一隻人類的手，現在請技術員做分析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海巡隊隊員遞來一個透明的器皿，裡面裝著被泡得發白腫脹的肢體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧契拉盯著那隻手一動不動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1391_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還好嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"不好。腦袋像炸裂了一樣，遮蔽了所有的理性。盧契拉僵硬地站了好一陣子，才能發出聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這的確是她的手……我們總是盯著同一塊操作面板，她在上面比劃來比劃去……我認得她的指甲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她手裡握著的是什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在技術員謹慎的處理下，一個用於儲存液體的小型密封罐被取了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這是……！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（原來是這樣。我明白了——被你緊緊握著的這個密封罐，這就是你的願望，安妮婭。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你知道嗎，我剛剛決定了。我可以幫你們，幫你們把帕波斯約出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g5_aegirstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盧契拉，距離會面還有五分鐘，帕波斯隨時會出現。你需要靠近建築物一點。你越走越偏了，出事的話我們很難及時趕到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盧契拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有回應。各組，做好盧契拉不配合的準備。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帕波斯出現。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來，快。海巡隊已經知道我們的計劃了。我要幫您逃走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？我需要更詳細的解釋……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及了，跑起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然擔心不是多餘的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各組注意，盧契拉正在協助深海教徒逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧契拉需要被當作新的嫌疑人進行追蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的舉動足以證明——她有背叛阿戈爾的意圖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g4_aegirstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是……城市水循環系統？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城市入水管道和穹頂是相連的，也在我的管轄範圍內。我權限內能鎖的門都鎖了，他們追上來還需要一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這和我們說好的不一樣，盧契拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城市在移動中，他們對穹頂的監視比平時更嚴密，只有城市入水口還不在他們的監視範圍內。只是需要人鑽進管道裡把東西截獲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等，讓我想想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，在擔心風險嗎？作為她最敬仰的老師，您的勇氣不會弱於安妮婭吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。事情突然變成這樣，我還能完全相信你嗎，盧契拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不需要信任彼此。您要您的東西，我為安妮婭完成最後的願望，僅此而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"帕波斯注視著盧契拉的雙眼，思考了片刻。\n如果要出賣他的話，盧契拉不會多此一舉地帶他逃跑。沒有人會做這樣效率低下的事。他鬆了口氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天見面的時候，你的眼裡滿是猶豫，而現在你眼裡的迷霧已經散去了。看來你做出了選擇，這很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那抓緊時間，您現在就需要進入管道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在……？我沒有穿任何防護裝備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在說什麼？安妮婭毫不猶豫地奪過了您手裡的誘導費洛蒙，而您卻在擔心這些小事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，我已經打開了加料口，維持不了太久，快進去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡面是……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"帕波斯發現不對勁的時候，感到後背被推了一下，徑直跌入了管道中。\n盧契拉隨後關閉了污水處理的加料口。她瞪著空氣，抓著把手的手在微微顫抖。\n但是過了一會兒，她回過神，幸災樂禍地笑了一聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g4_aegirstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔！這可怕的氣味！這，呃，包圍我的，難道不是污水嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盧契拉，你在那裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你找到東西了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的水流太激烈了！管壁很滑，我被……被沖得無法保持平衡！啊……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要忍耐一下，在水裡多摸摸。這是為了整個城市的未來啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"城市入水口的管道裡怎麼會是污水？唔！呸！嘔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我忘了告訴你嗎，這裡是城市的內循環管道，處理藻類發酵殘留物用的。城市入水口這麼重要的管道，怎麼會讓你說進就進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盧契拉，你在耍我……你為什麼……嘔！呃……咳咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……打開，放我出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我說說安妮婭，帕波斯。她最後是怎麼對你說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃……咳咳！這裡的空氣讓我無法呼吸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我，或者我們也可以繼續耗著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已經把該告訴你的都告訴你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，如果你一定要聽……唔，咳咳！海嗣攻佔能源站後，我意識到這是我唯一的機會——要趁城市還沒有撤離得太遠，把海嗣引過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我到達了能源站附近，卻發現安妮婭也趕過來了。匆忙出海導致她駕駛艙的能源沒來得及充滿——這是我後來才發現的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們離能源站很近，已經有海嗣發現了我們……我們沒時間交流了，至少要成功地釋放費洛蒙，把它們引向城市——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"於是安妮婭搶走我手裡的費洛蒙，承諾她會完成任務，叫我馬上回到城市，我就進入了駕駛艙——總得有人完成後備計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是她的駕駛艙動力不足，被海嗣拖住。最後我從駕駛艙的通訊裡聽到她一直在說，說她會抓緊的。咳咳咳！嘔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓緊什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣活體樣本，只能是這個。因為我向她提起過我的後備計劃，儘管曾經我們頗有爭執，但到了那一刻，我們心照不宣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的遺體，我已經拜託海巡隊找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你向海巡隊告了密？盧契拉你……真的懂安妮婭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，是啊，你總是躲在看不見海嗣的穹頂，望著那片純淨的水域，你又怎麼會理解她的感受，我的感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了她手心裡的東西，她即使被海嗣分食也要“抓緊”的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你把安妮婭拚命留下來的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是一支從未打開過的誘導費洛蒙，帕波斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安妮婭……和我說說，外海真的那麼恐怖嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我每天在最貼近海洋的地方工作，卻從未看見過它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能看見的，只有不斷出海的軍隊，還有你和你的導師，每天為了恢復大洋生態而努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有時候會想……一線的戰場究竟是什麼樣的？我從穹頂看到的安寧，究竟是你們用什麼換來的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"傻瓜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不需要知道。你不知道——才是最好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"安妮婭的眼睛微微睜大，抬起手來。盧契拉順著她手指的方向望向海洋，忍不住屏住呼吸。\n此時正值火山的岩漿從城市底下爬上海床，呈輻射狀一路映亮了海床上的礁石與生物。這樣的景色無論看幾次，盧契拉都不會厭倦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海底的夕照。真幸運！來晚了可就看不到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧契拉忍不住側過頭看著她的眼睛。安妮婭喜悅的眼睛裡映出了她們深愛的海洋，阿戈爾人的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“懷有希望之人”——我腦子裡突然蹦出這麼幾個字。對了，這是最近一場美術展的名字，什麼時候的展呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊，就在兩天後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那後天下班後的安排不就有了？我們去欣賞欣賞那些“懷有希望之人”的創作，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g4_aegirstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道，她自始至終沒有放開過誘導費洛蒙，沒有讓它把海嗣引向城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你……愚蠢的、懦弱的你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……盧契拉，你知道彌利亞留姆明明能夠抵禦這批海嗣，為什麼卻要撤走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"彌利亞留姆——它不是撤走，是向著陸地去了。阿戈爾還在做無用的掙扎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又來了，我真的聽不懂你在說什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來就好像遇到海嗣想逃跑，就叫無用的掙扎，與海嗣拚完命想回來看看澄澈的海，也是無用的掙扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那安妮婭救你的舉動，在你眼裡，也是無用的掙扎？！哈，那我可真是做對了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收手吧。你就算把我淹死在這裡，也證明不了對錯，更無益於未來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你……真的打算這樣做嗎，盧契拉……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，如果這是你認定的未來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"憤怒的掛斷聲將帕波斯的聲音切斷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g4_aegirstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1391_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在城市內循環入口發現盧契拉。沒有發現帕波斯的行蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二組三組搜尋帕波斯的行蹤。一組跟我上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧契拉，不要動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是第一次被這樣指著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕波斯在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不知道，我又不是公共養育所所長，人不見還要問我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他有重要的線索，還不能死。他在管道裡對嗎？在哪個位置？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海巡隊還真是自說自話，不聽人解釋呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼裡有憤怒。我處理過多次這樣的事件，受害者的親友眼裡，都有這樣無從紓解的憤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的時間不多了。從你們進入這裡到現在，已經過去了五分鐘。如果他真的在管道的某處，現在已經到達生理極限了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，溺死在廢水管道裡，不覺得是與他特別相稱的死法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說出他的位置，馬上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1391_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到嫌疑人帕波斯了！正在通知急救機器人過來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠處，渾身散發著惡臭的帕波斯直直地躺在地上，面色慘白，一動不動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看。他……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕波斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還活著——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1391_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好這裡的管道口開著，有新鮮空氣流入。我們發現他的時候他幾乎要失去意識，但還在試著往上爬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"聽到管道口是開著的，海巡隊隊長意識到了什麼，望向盧契拉，後者自嘲地笑了起來，笑著笑著，眼淚浸濕了眼眶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，原來我做不到。我沒辦法毀掉她最後的願望，付出生命也要拯救的人……便宜他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做了正確的選擇，再一次。我希望這一次你的選擇發自內心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧……你們沒有墮落的穹頂維護員需要處決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於給海巡隊帶來了這麼多麻煩，我接受處理。只是你們可要抓緊時間，我還有一場展覽要看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然陪我去的人不在了，但我答應過她，去看看那些人——看看他們所懷有的希望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧契拉向海巡隊的艦艇走去，然而神色卻比來時釋然，腳步也更輕快。她低頭看看自己的手，好像與那隻熟悉的手又握在了一起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
